flowchart LR
  USB[USB-C input] --> PMIC[Charger / NVDC power path]
  CELL[Internal protected 2x 18650; topology TBD] <--> PMIC
  PMIC --> T8L[T8L / ELRS rail]
  PMIC --> FIVE[5.1 V compute/display rail]
  PMIC --> QUIET[Filtered VRX/video rails]
  PMIC --> AON[Always-on MCU rail]
  EXT[External LiPo balance lead] --> PROTECT[Protected measurement only] --> ADC[Precision ADC]
  ADC --> MCU[MCU]
  MCU -->|shutdown / load control| PMIC
